3},{"id":"7630744907895819542","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@ridingwithrhi/video/7630744907895819542","authorHandle":"ridingwithrhi","description":"GRWM for a showjumping lesson, my last one before camp!  Wearing @ToggiClothing and @Champion Equestrian for whom I am a proud ambassador ❤️ #grwm #equestrianstyle #horses  ","views":1228},{"id":"7629604132105571606","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@ridingwithrhi/video/7629604132105571606","authorHandle":"ridingwithrhi","description":"Mindset training for equestrians is not about NOT feeling fear.. it’s about what happens when you do.  #horseridingtips #equestrian #mindsetshift ","views":1195},{"id":"7629241200779824406","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@ridingwithrhi/video/7629241200779824406","authorHandle":"ridingwithrhi","description":"Replying to @Becky :) how to shoot your shot with a brand, step by step!  If you go for it I’d love to hear how you get on ❤️ #creatortips  Ps I know the comment is over half my face.. it’s a big on my app that I can’t move it anymore 😂","views":2438},{"id":"7629033290648833302","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@ridingwithrhi/video/7629033290648833302","authorHandle":"ridingwithrhi","description":"Don’t tell me off x  Why you should replace your riding hat after a fall  AD - ambassador | Don’t tell me off 😆 thank you @championequestrian  Hat in this video: Champion Revolve Vent Air MIPS Jockey Helmet in Silver  The safety videos overlaid here are from championequestrian.com/pages/safety-standards #horseridingtips #horseridinghat #horseriding #equestrianlife ","views":3392},{"id":"7629002341164928278","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@ridingwithrhi/video/7629002341164928278","authorHandle":"ridingwithrhi","description":"Replying to @jessfortey 😆😆😆 we’ve been on a journey girl x ","views":2015},{"id":"7628496074675604758","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@ridingwithrhi/video/7628496074675604758","authorHandle":"ridingwithrhi","description":"Replying to @Emma Wild anti-perspirant update! 1 week in…  #